(5609113, 813139, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off slightly overprocessed to me, but still an interesting shot. I like the way you used the man in the foreground to frame the scene.</td>', 'Comes off slightly overprocessed to me, but still an interesting shot. I like the way you used the man in the foreground to frame the scene.', '2009-08-12 13:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
