(5609116, 813290, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems like a really good snapshot of your kid and dog. The boy''s head being slightly cut off is my only real nitpick.</td>', 'Seems like a really good snapshot of your kid and dog. The boy''s head being slightly cut off is my only real nitpick.', '2009-08-12 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
