(5609127, 812999, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the processing, I see you are enjoying the new basic editing rules. Might be cropped a little too tight for my own preferences. The end of her  foot and tip of her head being cut off makes the frame seem cramped.</td>', 'I like the processing, I see you are enjoying the new basic editing rules. Might be cropped a little too tight for my own preferences. The end of her  foot and tip of her head being cut off makes the frame seem cramped.', '2009-08-12 13:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609130, 812351, 56275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and really freaky at the same time! =)</td>', 'Beautiful, and really freaky at the same time! =)', '2009-08-12 13:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609134, 812472, 83313, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this done to that <strike>annoying</strike> obnoxious gecko from the insurance ads. The photo seems a little flat. Out of curiosity, I popped it into my favorite editor and some quick adjustments gave it a lot more visual pop. Great humor, however!</td>', 'I would love to see this done to that annoying obnoxious gecko from the insurance ads. The photo seems a little flat. Out of curiosity, I popped it into my favorite editor and some quick adjustments gave it a lot more visual pop. Great humor, however!', '2009-08-12 14:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609137, 812250, 83313, '<td valign="top">If you ever figure out a way around that banding in sky, please let me know. It''s a result of the 8 bit depth of JPEG, so it does not get held against the shot, which is well done. Nice dynamic angle and great rush of the water.</td>', 'If you ever figure out a way around that banding in sky, please let me know. It''s a result of the 8 bit depth of JPEG, so it does not get held against the shot, which is well done. Nice dynamic angle and great rush of the water.', '2009-08-12 14:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609138, 812287, 83313, '<td valign="top">She''d better watch out for the big bad wolf.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=728734" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/928/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_728734.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/928/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_728734.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/928/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_728734.jpg"/></a></td>', 'She''d better watch out for the big bad wolf.', '2009-08-12 14:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609140, 812719, 92577, '<td valign="top">I''d love to give this a higher score but you have to get the eye(s) in focus. It reminds me so much of one of mine I''m taking the liberty of showing it here: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=745471" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/92577/120/745471.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/92577/120/745471.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/92577/120/745471.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I''d love to give this a higher score but you have to get the eye(s) in focus. It reminds me so much of one of mine I''m taking the liberty of showing it here: ', '2009-08-12 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609141, 812676, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool twirly flames, but the whole image just looks soft and a bit odd to me. With a 64k file size, the problem may be excessive JPEG compression taking away much of the detail from this shot. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit.</td>', 'Cool twirly flames, but the whole image just looks soft and a bit odd to me. With a 64k file size, the problem may be excessive JPEG compression taking away much of the detail from this shot. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit.', '2009-08-12 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609145, 813156, 83313, '<td valign="top">Coming off to me as just ok, but nothing that grabs my attention, I''m afraid. I''m not a huge floral fan and a flower shot really has to wow me. Not totally sure what it is. The main subject seems squeezed a little far down in the frame to me. Sorry.</td>', 'Coming off to me as just ok, but nothing that grabs my attention, I''m afraid. I''m not a huge floral fan and a flower shot really has to wow me. Not totally sure what it is. The main subject seems squeezed a little far down in the frame to me. Sorry.', '2009-08-12 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5609146, 813405, 83313, '<td valign="top">A relaxing scene. Nice blue ripples. Good stuff.</td>', 'A relaxing scene. Nice blue ripples. Good stuff.', '2009-08-12 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
