(5610776, 812790, 40028, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great shot except for the white sky and the tilted horizon.</td>', 'This could have been a great shot except for the white sky and the tilted horizon.', '2009-08-13 18:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610784, 812838, 88247, '<td valign="top">Love the way you managed to get that flickering flame into a heart shape?<br/>Great shot to go with the title!<br/>"Old Flame"!! XX:-)</td>', 'Love the way you managed to get that flickering flame into a heart shape?Great shot to go with the title!"Old Flame"!! XX:-)', '2009-08-13 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610917, 813177, 107410, '<td valign="top">I can hear it now... "But he''s not sailing...DNMC...WAH"<br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'I can hear it now... "But he''s not sailing...DNMC...WAH" Great shot!', '2009-08-13 20:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610919, 813250, 107410, '<td valign="top">Why does the girl on the left have a "who''s the creepy guy with the camera" expression?<br/> <br/>In all seriousness, this looks too much like a snapshot. Maybe bring the camera down to their eye level and use a wider aperture to make them stand out from their background?</td>', 'Why does the girl on the left have a "who''s the creepy guy with the camera" expression? In all seriousness, this looks too much like a snapshot. Maybe bring the camera down to their eye level and use a wider aperture to make them stand out from their background?', '2009-08-13 20:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610927, 812481, 107410, '<td valign="top">It''s just too dark...there are no shadows left, just black. Maybe that was the look that you were going for...?</td>', 'It''s just too dark...there are no shadows left, just black. Maybe that was the look that you were going for...?', '2009-08-13 21:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610962, 813139, 107410, '<td valign="top">Neat idea but it seems too overprocessed.</td>', 'Neat idea but it seems too overprocessed.', '2009-08-13 21:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610976, 813155, 107410, '<td valign="top">I love the compressed feeling of this from the tele lens. And although I think that B&amp;W is really overdone on DPC, it WORKS for this shot. 10</td>', 'I love the compressed feeling of this from the tele lens. And although I think that B&W is really overdone on DPC, it WORKS for this shot. 10', '2009-08-13 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610977, 813292, 107410, '<td valign="top">You should''ve been where that other photographer is!!!!</td>', 'You should''ve been where that other photographer is!!!!', '2009-08-13 21:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5610992, 812248, 107410, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Way to get a great shot when it counts! It''s really sharp and contrasty. 9</td>', 'Nice capture! Way to get a great shot when it counts! It''s really sharp and contrasty. 9', '2009-08-13 22:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611021, 813047, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a great picture, but needs a slightly tighter crop.</td>', 'I think it''s a great picture, but needs a slightly tighter crop.', '2009-08-13 22:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611027, 812682, 108525, '<td valign="top">It''s a great idea, but nothing in the picture leads my eye to the subject.</td>', 'It''s a great idea, but nothing in the picture leads my eye to the subject.', '2009-08-13 22:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611035, 813270, 108525, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t seem quite in focus...</td>', 'it doesn''t seem quite in focus...', '2009-08-13 22:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611043, 813029, 108525, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot.  He either needs to be looking the other way, or have the open space in the picture be on the other side.  My eyes keep following his.</td>', 'I really like the shot.  He either needs to be looking the other way, or have the open space in the picture be on the other side.  My eyes keep following his.', '2009-08-13 22:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611116, 812986, 51538, '<td valign="top">I remember books by Arthur Mee from my childhood and good they were.</td>', 'I remember books by Arthur Mee from my childhood and good they were.', '2009-08-13 23:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611121, 813225, 104966, '<td valign="top">I would say so. yikes! an 8.</td>', 'I would say so. yikes! an 8.', '2009-08-13 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611133, 813403, 107410, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. How tall is this statue, the perspective is powerful.</td>', 'Nice angle. How tall is this statue, the perspective is powerful.', '2009-08-13 23:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611134, 812472, 107410, '<td valign="top">It''s cute...but would''ve been better if you pulled it off the curtain/backdrop.</td>', 'It''s cute...but would''ve been better if you pulled it off the curtain/backdrop.', '2009-08-13 23:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611135, 812468, 107410, '<td valign="top">That Topaz Detail works pretty well...but I don''t think it should be allowed in Basic...(but it is so 8)</td>', 'That Topaz Detail works pretty well...but I don''t think it should be allowed in Basic...(but it is so 8)', '2009-08-13 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611141, 813297, 107410, '<td valign="top">Pair a'' Dice....got it! LOL!</td>', 'Pair a'' Dice....got it! LOL!', '2009-08-13 23:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611144, 812763, 107410, '<td valign="top">It looks like it has a slight rightward lean to it...other than that, nice shot.</td>', 'It looks like it has a slight rightward lean to it...other than that, nice shot.', '2009-08-13 23:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611148, 813293, 107410, '<td valign="top">Whoa, that''s a crazy looking cat!</td>', 'Whoa, that''s a crazy looking cat!', '2009-08-13 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611150, 813029, 107410, '<td valign="top">I hate the cables behind him. Other than that, it has a really nice feel to it.</td>', 'I hate the cables behind him. Other than that, it has a really nice feel to it.', '2009-08-13 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611152, 813173, 107410, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some major depth of field! 10! FAVE!</td>', 'Wow, that is some major depth of field! 10! FAVE!', '2009-08-13 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611154, 812999, 107410, '<td valign="top">The fur on the dog looks like you took the Topaz too far...if I''m off base, PM me and let me know.<br/> <br/>The girl is really cute and well done though.</td>', 'The fur on the dog looks like you took the Topaz too far...if I''m off base, PM me and let me know. The girl is really cute and well done though.', '2009-08-13 23:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611156, 812719, 107410, '<td valign="top">I wish the eye was sharper.</td>', 'I wish the eye was sharper.', '2009-08-13 23:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611187, 813211, 108525, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit too dark.</td>', 'It''s a bit too dark.', '2009-08-14 00:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611193, 813133, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think cropping of the foreground would do this picture wonders.</td>', 'I think cropping of the foreground would do this picture wonders.', '2009-08-14 00:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611198, 812787, 77521, '<td valign="top">hahahahaa....ok honestly the technical on this shot are nowhere near perfect, i would love the dog to have eye contact, etc. but this has GOT to be the cutest thing ever!! 8 :)</td>', 'hahahahaa....ok honestly the technical on this shot are nowhere near perfect, i would love the dog to have eye contact, etc. but this has GOT to be the cutest thing ever!! 8 :)', '2009-08-14 00:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611225, 812947, 50695, '<td valign="top">W.B. Yeats. What a book.</td>', 'W.B. Yeats. What a book.', '2009-08-14 01:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611242, 813327, 108525, '<td valign="top">This captures the story perfectly!</td>', 'This captures the story perfectly!', '2009-08-14 01:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611245, 813070, 108525, '<td valign="top">seems a bit too dark</td>', 'seems a bit too dark', '2009-08-14 01:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611246, 813135, 108525, '<td valign="top">this would be perfect with out the foot kicking her in the head. =)</td>', 'this would be perfect with out the foot kicking her in the head. =)', '2009-08-14 01:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611247, 812248, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love it.  It just needs a side to side crop</td>', 'I love it.  It just needs a side to side crop', '2009-08-14 01:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611249, 813120, 108525, '<td valign="top">OOF</td>', 'OOF', '2009-08-14 01:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611252, 813391, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think it would have helped to zoom in closer on the horse and just the river.  This would cause the horse to become a more focused subject instead of just part of the scenery.</td>', 'I think it would have helped to zoom in closer on the horse and just the river.  This would cause the horse to become a more focused subject instead of just part of the scenery.', '2009-08-14 02:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611254, 813290, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good picture, but would be great if you cropped it a bit.  Bring the right side in to just exclude the boy''s brows, so that the pup is in the center of the pic.</td>', 'I think this is a good picture, but would be great if you cropped it a bit.  Bring the right side in to just exclude the boy''s brows, so that the pup is in the center of the pic.', '2009-08-14 02:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611265, 812468, 49220, '<td valign="top">That is some very clear water.  I like it.  It''s a shame the people aren''t doing something a little bit more interesting.</td>', 'That is some very clear water.  I like it.  It''s a shame the people aren''t doing something a little bit more interesting.', '2009-08-14 02:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611269, 812947, 49220, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how the lower half is so blurred in the refection compared to the clouds, but the dock and tower are still in sharp focus even though they are not near each other.  I''m wondering how you managed to have that effect in a with basic editing.  Still, I really like how the effect focuses the attention on the tower.</td>', 'It''s interesting how the lower half is so blurred in the refection compared to the clouds, but the dock and tower are still in sharp focus even though they are not near each other.  I''m wondering how you managed to have that effect in a with basic editing.  Still, I really like how the effect focuses the attention on the tower.', '2009-08-14 02:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611271, 812525, 49220, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.</td>', 'Simple but effective.', '2009-08-14 02:45:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5611272, 812790, 49220, '<td valign="top">Correct me if I''m wrong (I''m no farmer), but that looks more like wheat or some sort of grain than corn.  Still, I do like the picture and use of depth of field.  The trees sticking up in the background are a little distracting for me.</td>', 'Correct me if I''m wrong (I''m no farmer), but that looks more like wheat or some sort of grain than corn.  Still, I do like the picture and use of depth of field.  The trees sticking up in the background are a little distracting for me.', '2009-08-14 02:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611273, 812719, 49220, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the depth of field is so narrow that the head is slightly out of focus.  I might have liked it more either cropped for the head (although that might not have been that great with this particular shot), or cropped wider to show the full bird.</td>', 'It''s a shame the depth of field is so narrow that the head is slightly out of focus.  I might have liked it more either cropped for the head (although that might not have been that great with this particular shot), or cropped wider to show the full bird.', '2009-08-14 02:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611275, 813160, 49220, '<td valign="top">Very nice with the subtle contrast between the shades of green.  The fog in the background might help with the idea of the title, but I think I would have preferred the picture more if the hills in the distance were not obscured by it.</td>', 'Very nice with the subtle contrast between the shades of green.  The fog in the background might help with the idea of the title, but I think I would have preferred the picture more if the hills in the distance were not obscured by it.', '2009-08-14 02:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611277, 812481, 49220, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, although I think it is a shame not to pull out and show more of it.  I''m not totally sold that this was the best location to take the shot from for the best perspective.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, although I think it is a shame not to pull out and show more of it.  I''m not totally sold that this was the best location to take the shot from for the best perspective.', '2009-08-14 02:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611278, 813292, 49220, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the action.  It''s a shame the background is so white and uninteresting.  It almost seems to blow out the picture for me.</td>', 'Nice capture of the action.  It''s a shame the background is so white and uninteresting.  It almost seems to blow out the picture for me.', '2009-08-14 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611280, 813260, 49220, '<td valign="top">I really like the cat and the pose you got from it.  I''m not sure I would call it "sophisticated" any more so than a normal cat, but I do like the color, contrast, sharpness, and the lighting.</td>', 'I really like the cat and the pose you got from it.  I''m not sure I would call it "sophisticated" any more so than a normal cat, but I do like the color, contrast, sharpness, and the lighting.', '2009-08-14 02:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611283, 813079, 49220, '<td valign="top">The jagged edge of the picture pieces make it look like this was out of focus and then over sharpened.  While the reflection looks great, the direct light on the pieces is almost a little bit too much and on the verge of having them look blown out.  Not sure I like the crop all that much - I probably would have centered it and left off a lot of the top to be able to gain more resolution on the subject.</td>', 'The jagged edge of the picture pieces make it look like this was out of focus and then over sharpened.  While the reflection looks great, the direct light on the pieces is almost a little bit too much and on the verge of having them look blown out.  Not sure I like the crop all that much - I probably would have centered it and left off a lot of the top to be able to gain more resolution on the subject.', '2009-08-14 03:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611286, 812714, 49220, '<td valign="top">Wow, a very nice shot.  I love the color in the balloon, and how the back lighting just adds to the contrast in the balloon.  I might have cropped it closer on the balloon since the green countryside is not all that interesting, and it would have removed the vignette from the lens while drawing more focus to the subject.  Were you in another balloon or something else to get that great perspective looking down?</td>', 'Wow, a very nice shot.  I love the color in the balloon, and how the back lighting just adds to the contrast in the balloon.  I might have cropped it closer on the balloon since the green countryside is not all that interesting, and it would have removed the vignette from the lens while drawing more focus to the subject.  Were you in another balloon or something else to get that great perspective looking down?', '2009-08-14 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611287, 812978, 49220, '<td valign="top">I think I would have gone for a shot of an actual butterfly.  I''m not sure what that halo effect on the lower "wings" is, but it distracts me, and makes it look out of focus or something.</td>', 'I think I would have gone for a shot of an actual butterfly.  I''m not sure what that halo effect on the lower "wings" is, but it distracts me, and makes it look out of focus or something.', '2009-08-14 03:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611288, 812880, 49220, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, although the contrast is almost a bit too high for my taste.  The highlights all seem to be on the verge of blown out.</td>', 'Nice picture, although the contrast is almost a bit too high for my taste.  The highlights all seem to be on the verge of blown out.', '2009-08-14 03:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611291, 812838, 49220, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, although I''m not sure it needs so much black background, especially on the bottom.</td>', 'Nice shot, although I''m not sure it needs so much black background, especially on the bottom.', '2009-08-14 03:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611293, 813291, 49220, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of saturating specific colors while desaturating others.  The flower is really a nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice use of saturating specific colors while desaturating others.  The flower is really a nice touch.', '2009-08-14 03:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611295, 813369, 49220, '<td valign="top">The shot is a little boring to me.  An actual well with an old wooden bucket might have been better, assuming you could find one.</td>', 'The shot is a little boring to me.  An actual well with an old wooden bucket might have been better, assuming you could find one.', '2009-08-14 03:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611297, 813199, 49220, '<td valign="top">I think I would have shifted the hue so that the hat actually came out red and not orange.  I do like the picture though, and the nice contrast in the black and white.</td>', 'I think I would have shifted the hue so that the hat actually came out red and not orange.  I do like the picture though, and the nice contrast in the black and white.', '2009-08-14 03:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611300, 813272, 49220, '<td valign="top">A very ethereal shot.  I like the color and sense of perspective the rocks add.  The silhouette in the distance is also great.</td>', 'A very ethereal shot.  I like the color and sense of perspective the rocks add.  The silhouette in the distance is also great.', '2009-08-14 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611302, 813178, 49220, '<td valign="top">The rhino really looks lonely.  It''s a shame the contrast is a bit flat.</td>', 'The rhino really looks lonely.  It''s a shame the contrast is a bit flat.', '2009-08-14 03:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611303, 813270, 49220, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful water and reflection.  I love the greens and blues in the water.</td>', 'Very beautiful water and reflection.  I love the greens and blues in the water.', '2009-08-14 03:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611305, 813258, 49220, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect, and I like the choice to have drops of water on the apple.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect, and I like the choice to have drops of water on the apple.', '2009-08-14 03:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611307, 813241, 49220, '<td valign="top">I caught the fire.  It took me a second to see the rain.</td>', 'I caught the fire.  It took me a second to see the rain.', '2009-08-14 03:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611309, 813299, 49220, '<td valign="top">That''s not a hobbit!</td>', 'That''s not a hobbit!', '2009-08-14 03:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611310, 812515, 49220, '<td valign="top">Rather gruesome.  The lighting is a bit flat and uninteresting, especially on the ones to the left in the back.</td>', 'Rather gruesome.  The lighting is a bit flat and uninteresting, especially on the ones to the left in the back.', '2009-08-14 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611311, 813286, 49220, '<td valign="top">I love night photography (assuming that''s what this is).  Very beautiful with the clouds in the sky, which give a nice sense of the immense size of the tree.</td>', 'I love night photography (assuming that''s what this is).  Very beautiful with the clouds in the sky, which give a nice sense of the immense size of the tree.', '2009-08-14 03:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611312, 813414, 49220, '<td valign="top">Maybe if I was at all familiar with the book, I might see how the title related to the shot.  Kind of uninteresting for me.</td>', 'Maybe if I was at all familiar with the book, I might see how the title related to the shot.  Kind of uninteresting for me.', '2009-08-14 03:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611313, 813398, 49220, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds.  It would have been nice to have a bit wider crop to get more of them in the shot, but I still really like the mill and the good contrast.</td>', 'I love the clouds.  It would have been nice to have a bit wider crop to get more of them in the shot, but I still really like the mill and the good contrast.', '2009-08-14 03:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611454, 813029, 73541, '<td valign="top">that cable produces a good partition, a red and a black one.. as the clothes, intention? or luck?<br/>I think you caught a good expression, I like that the boy isn''t in the center and the chosen aperture produces a suitable low depth of field. I wished there was more light on the face, though. 7</td>', 'that cable produces a good partition, a red and a black one.. as the clothes, intention? or luck?I think you caught a good expression, I like that the boy isn''t in the center and the chosen aperture produces a suitable low depth of field. I wished there was more light on the face, though. 7', '2009-08-14 08:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611455, 813369, 73541, '<td valign="top">I''d center it, harmonic colors, but didn''t catch me, 5</td>', 'I''d center it, harmonic colors, but didn''t catch me, 5', '2009-08-14 08:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611457, 812173, 73541, '<td valign="top">why desaturated? I''m sure it was colorful.<br/>Bet the picture was there before the title... :-)<br/>More contrast could have done a good job.</td>', 'why desaturated? I''m sure it was colorful.Bet the picture was there before the title... :-)More contrast could have done a good job.', '2009-08-14 08:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611459, 812673, 73541, '<td valign="top">very harsh light</td>', 'very harsh light', '2009-08-14 08:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611461, 813272, 73541, '<td valign="top">pretty, but seen so many times, 8</td>', 'pretty, but seen so many times, 8', '2009-08-14 08:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611464, 812719, 73541, '<td valign="top">unfortunately the focus isn''t on the head and I can''t see a reason why it shouldn''t be</td>', 'unfortunately the focus isn''t on the head and I can''t see a reason why it shouldn''t be', '2009-08-14 08:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611469, 813179, 73541, '<td valign="top">needs more contrast, I think</td>', 'needs more contrast, I think', '2009-08-14 08:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611473, 813417, 73541, '<td valign="top">I might be among only a few giving this a 10 and it might be the only challenge and the only book title to make me do that. I think that picture is beautiful, 10</td>', 'I might be among only a few giving this a 10 and it might be the only challenge and the only book title to make me do that. I think that picture is beautiful, 10', '2009-08-14 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611475, 812979, 73541, '<td valign="top">a bit pale, but sharp and appealing background color,8</td>', 'a bit pale, but sharp and appealing background color,8', '2009-08-14 09:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611477, 813327, 73541, '<td valign="top">is this basic editing?<br/>anyway, it works and takes me back to the emotions of the book, 8</td>', 'is this basic editing?anyway, it works and takes me back to the emotions of the book, 8', '2009-08-14 09:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611479, 812986, 73541, '<td valign="top">is this basic editing?<br/>I will assume it is, 9</td>', 'is this basic editing?I will assume it is, 9', '2009-08-14 09:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611481, 813328, 73541, '<td valign="top">I''d have centered it, you lose one point, 9</td>', 'I''d have centered it, you lose one point, 9', '2009-08-14 09:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611483, 812250, 73541, '<td valign="top">i''d love to make b/ws like that!, 9</td>', 'i''d love to make b/ws like that!, 9', '2009-08-14 09:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611484, 812279, 73541, '<td valign="top">sharp and crispy</td>', 'sharp and crispy', '2009-08-14 09:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611486, 813098, 73541, '<td valign="top">if the noise isn''t intentional, try a lower iso setting or use a noise reduction software, either trees nor moon are sharp</td>', 'if the noise isn''t intentional, try a lower iso setting or use a noise reduction software, either trees nor moon are sharp', '2009-08-14 09:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611487, 813208, 83600, '<td valign="top">super best for me so far</td>', 'super best for me so far', '2009-08-14 09:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611488, 813398, 73541, '<td valign="top">no dodge or burn?<br/>anyway, 7</td>', 'no dodge or burn?anyway, 7', '2009-08-14 09:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611489, 812129, 83600, '<td valign="top">So cool, made my day!</td>', 'So cool, made my day!', '2009-08-14 09:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5611491, 813388, 83600, '<td valign="top">very clever :-]</td>', 'very clever :-]', '2009-08-14 09:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
