(5613654, 813328, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice ship, the mist/fog really adds.  A critique regarding the composition though - I would have liked it better with more room to move into on the left side.  Right now it''s too centered and a bit cramped.  I don''t care for the white border.  It is the brightest, most contrasty element of the image and thus pulls our attention to it.  I don''t think that is what you want.  6</td>', 'Nice ship, the mist/fog really adds.  A critique regarding the composition though - I would have liked it better with more room to move into on the left side.  Right now it''s too centered and a bit cramped.  I don''t care for the white border.  It is the brightest, most contrasty element of the image and thus pulls our attention to it.  I don''t think that is what you want.  6', '2009-08-17 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
