(5616347, 812684, 107410, '<td valign="top">I loved this image! My only thoughts are the trash and maybe change the crop to cut out the bottom 1/8 of the frame as it doesn''t seem to add much to the image...and, well, the barrel distortion, but obviously there''s really nothing you can do about that under Basic. 8<br/> <br/>- Alex</td>', 'I loved this image! My only thoughts are the trash and maybe change the crop to cut out the bottom 1/8 of the frame as it doesn''t seem to add much to the image...and, well, the barrel distortion, but obviously there''s really nothing you can do about that under Basic. 8 - Alex', '2009-08-19 03:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
