(5616740, 813201, 61961, '<td valign="top">I really like how the activity surrounding the game, and the town backdrop, is the subject, rather than the game itself.  Nice exposure of sky and field lights.  Wow, there are a lot of spectators for a presumably small town!  I wonder if standing a bit higher (e.g., on a car hood) would help de-emphasize the car parked front and center?</td>', 'I really like how the activity surrounding the game, and the town backdrop, is the subject, rather than the game itself.  Nice exposure of sky and field lights.  Wow, there are a lot of spectators for a presumably small town!  I wonder if standing a bit higher (e.g., on a car hood) would help de-emphasize the car parked front and center?', '2009-08-19 10:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
