(5616795, 813152, 55005, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club and welcome to DPC!<br/> <br/>First impression:  I have hard time figuring out what this is without reading your notes.  The photo does not grab my attention for very long, I find the background bokeh more interesting than the main subject.<br/> <br/>Technicals: Lighter background grabs my attention, I wish there was more light on the subject so that a viewer can appreciate all the dents and textures of the metal and the wood. While the focus is good, your composition is too central for me and I feel that a tighter crop would have put more focus on the subject and made the photo more interesting.   <br/> <br/>Final thoughts:  For someone not familiar with the culture, it is hard to figure out what this photo is about, the lighter background took over your photo. Focusing on a specific element -- contrasted textures, a drop of water, etc. would have provided more reference points for the viewer.<br/> <br/>Please feel free to PM me with any questions.<br/> <br/>Cheers, <br/> <br/>Anna</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club and welcome to DPC! First impression:  I have hard time figuring out what this is without reading your notes.  The photo does not grab my attention for very long, I find the background bokeh more interesting than the main subject. Technicals: Lighter background grabs my attention, I wish there was more light on the subject so that a viewer can appreciate all the dents and textures of the metal and the wood. While the focus is good, your composition is too central for me and I feel that a tighter crop would have put more focus on the subject and made the photo more interesting.    Final thoughts:  For someone not familiar with the culture, it is hard to figure out what this photo is about, the lighter background took over your photo. Focusing on a specific element -- contrasted textures, a drop of water, etc. would have provided more reference points for the viewer. Please feel free to PM me with any questions. Cheers,  Anna', '2009-08-19 10:43:09.000000', NULL, 0),
